    <string name="landing_about_resort_title">About the Resort</string>
    <string name="landing_about_resort_body">Established on December 8, 2004, Agua Frio Garden Resort Inc. began as a simple place for families and friends to enjoy quality time together. As the years passed, it continued to grow—adding Villa Rooms in 2006, Claricon Rooms and function halls in 2010, and KTV Rooms and entertainment facilities in 2016. Through every change, Agua Frio has remained a place where guests can relax, celebrate, and create cherished memories together.</string>
    <string name="landing_about_owners_title">About the Owners</string>
    <string name="landing_about_owners_body">Agua Frio Garden Resort Inc. is owned and managed by the Pascua siblings, who inherited the resort from their parents as part of their family legacy. They work together to oversee its operations and continued development while preserving Agua Frio as a place for relaxation, recreation, and memorable gatherings.</string>

